     {
      "description": "An event the retention sweep deleted, served at its original URL.\n\n`app/pipeline/retention.py` hard-deletes events closed more than 10\ndays ago. This row is what it captured on the way out, and it is all\nthat exists: there is no market history, no chart, no similar-events\nlist behind it. `/history` and `/similar` on the same id keep 404ing.\n\nRows are written once and never refreshed (see\n`retention.capture_event_tombstones`), so every field here describes\nthe event's final observed state, not its current one.",
